<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary auctions.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has completed all three auctions in the secondary market whereby it sought to drain 1.726 billion pesos of liquidity.</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS   TERM     MAX    MIN    AVERAGE  BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p> 700  million pesos  11 days  25.65  25.65  25.65    1    1</p>
<p> 700  million pesos   4 days  25.40  25.30  25.36    4    4</p>
<p> 326  million pesos   1 day   24.79  24.79  24.79    1    1</p>
<p>NOTE - The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500))</p>
